.git/
.venv-forecast/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
frontend/
.claude/
.DS_Store
*.md
*.png

# Never let a local dev .env (with real secrets) get baked into the image by "COPY . ."
# -- the API key is passed at runtime via --env-file instead. The **/ prefix matters:
# dockerignore patterns match the full path from the context root, so a bare ".env" would
# only catch a root-level one and miss backend/.env -- which is precisely the file
# app/config.py loads via load_dotenv(BACKEND_DIR / ".env").
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
